==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 21.67 seconds<sup>650f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
**8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this stage features only [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to deal with them. Three meatshields are recommended for St. Pigge the 2nd if you have low leveled ones.

